Debug.Assert(RET < 0 || RET >= OLD(_size)); //@@@ Index is either -1 or greater than or equal to 0 and less than or equal to the size of the ArrayList
</code>
--------------------
Debug.Assert(RET >= 0 && RET < _size);
</code>
Please note that the debug assertion will always fail if '_size' is not a public or internally accessible field of the ArrayList class, and this assertion assumes that the function is supposed to return an integer that represents the index of the object inserted.
